@startuml F5.12-ERRO-01-bulk-conflict
title F5.12-ERRO-01 — 409 falha parcial por concorrência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar lote
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /requests/bulk-deliberate
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT FOR UPDATE
Postgres --> Ctrl: count < N
note right of Ctrl
  sem BEGIN TX
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 409 bulk_conflict
WebApp --> Sec: AlertBanner failedIds

@enduml
